ind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey Demo is now live!","summary":"Hello Adventurers!It's been a while since the last update, and we'd like to officially share with you that-Rogue's Odyssey Demo is officially LIVE! Accompanied by this month's Steam Next Fest.Later this year, we will also be participating in several festivals, including Thailand Game Show x Gamescom Asia ːsteammockingːBunch of exciting news, but our surprises don't end there; we want to confirm with you that the early access version of Rogue's Odyssey will also be released in November! So, stay ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:00:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029409","verified_at":"2026-10-21T16:50:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1833334318577228","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey - v051","summary":"Hello Adventurers!Rogue's Odyssey v0.51 is now live! This version focuses on filling in all the missing features that are needed for our official demo launch, which will be happening within the next 3 months.Here's what we have for version 0.51:Improved Multiplayer to be smoother and fixed some minor bugsRedecorated Gathering HallNew feature: DialogueWe now have Dialogue feature that will allow us to narrate the story of Rogue's Odyssey, which you may not be aware that they exist ːsteammockingːN","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-25T13:55:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318577228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1831432155568498","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey - v05","summary":"Hello adventurer! We're happy to announce that Rogue's Odyssey v0.5 major milestone is now live! Here's what we bring with this update:Multiplayer Beta is added.Acolyte Class is now playable.New map: Forest Ruin.2 new mobs.1 new boss.3 new MVP cards.New feature: ShopNew feature: Exploration Map3 new itemsHeartstone: Increase damage output by 3% for every 100 Max Health.Viper's Needle: On basic attack: Inflict \"Poisoned\".Growth Serum: Every 20s, gain +2 random stats per stack.Seamless Level Loadi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-30T14:55:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155568498","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1818752592128302","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey x Southeast Asia Games Onward 2025","summary":"It's happening now! Starting from today until December 31st, Rogue's Odyssey will be participating in Southeast Asia Games Onward 2025, organised by @seagamethetic ❤️Don't forget to come visit us and support our fellow creators from Southeast Asia. We appreciate all the love!Cheers, Duggoman","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-12T17:38:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592128302","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1818118366180118","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey - v049a","summary":"Hello adventurer! We're happy to announce that Rogue's Odyssey v0.49a is now live! Here's what we bring with this update:Fully functional settingsWell, kinda.. The setting works, but it doesn't save after reloading the game. ːsteammockingːGraphic improvementPerformance optimizationLower texture VRAM costs by 60%.Lower drawcall for certain stages.Small bug fixesIf you encounter any issues, drop by us on Discord 🔗: https://discord.gg/Wz256uFVvx","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-07T08:26:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366180118","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1814309641534824","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey - v049","summary":"Hello adventurer!First of all, I'd like to say thank you to everyone for your support. It means a lot to me!It's been quite a journey since I released Rogue's Odyssey store page 3 months ago, and now I'm happy to announce that we've finally reached 1,000+ wishlists! ːsteamhappyːːwinter2019happydogːWith our participation in Gamescom Asia x Thailand Game Show, it helps bring in a lot of people to the game, so I'd like to welcome you all with my wholehearted ❤️On this occasion, I'd also like to sha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-26T10:49:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641534824","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1813674388944217","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey x Gamescom Asia","summary":"Hello adventurer! We're happy to announce that Rogue's Odyssey v0.48 is now live and playable BOTH on Itch.io and Steam! And besides the new version, as usual, we're also happy to announce that we are participating in Gamescom Asia x Thailand Game Show this year ːsteamhappyː With this update, we're bringing many brand new contents as listed below:Major bug fixesTransmutation and Extra Hand are now working with projectile skillsCamera is now not clipping everywhere with environmentBuff Warrior an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-16T17:13:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813674388944217","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1813041031300664","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey - v047","summary":"Hello adventurer! We're happy to announce that Rogue's Odyssey v0.47 is now live and playable BOTH on Itch.io and Steam! With this update, we're bringing many brand new contents as listed below:Controller Support updated. ːsteamthumbsupːYou can now use a generic controller to play the game (does not yet support DualShock controller)This feature is still in beta. If you encounter any issues, don't hesitate to reach out to us on Discord! Automatically attack mobs back. ːsteamthumbsupːWhen you're a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-12T09:46:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1813041031300664","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1811772772514886","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Odyssey - v046","summary":"Hello adventurer! We're happy to announce that Rogue's Odyssey v0.46 is now live and playable BOTH on Itch.io and Steam! With this update, we're bringing many brand new contents as listed below:Fixed certain classes' AI Behaviour:It appears that some recruits will stupidly attack themselves after self-casting any buff skills..UI Overhaul:We overhauled most of the game UI. Now it looks pretty pretty ⭐Balancing:Cat's Ultimate no longer removes the ultimate's cooldown.Small bug fixes If you encount","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-03T16:47:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772514886","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1811772772309957","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Log #Playtest","summary":"Hello adventurer! We're happy to announce that Rogue's Odyssey v0.45 is now live and playable BOTH on Itch.io and Steam! With this update, we're bringing many brand new contents as listed below:Added 2 new classes:Alchemist: Enhancing basic attacks, making them inflict status effects.Cat: Outmaneuver your enemies, dealing extra damage when they're slowed.Added 'On the Hunt' feature:10 minutes after staying in the same map, 'Death Knight' will be spawned and hunt you!Added Status text popupNow pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-27T13:07:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772309957","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1807332909559533","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Log #DebutFest","summary":"We're excited to share that we've been selected to be a part of 'Steam Debut Festival 2025'!🥳❤️Starting from August 7-11, you'll be seeing us on the Debut Fest page on Steam, so don't be shy to drop us a wishlist!Discord 🔗: https://discord.gg/Wz256uFVvx","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-07T05:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909559533","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3792120-1806698490651656","game_id":"steam-3792120","kind":"announcement","title":"Rogue's Log #1","summary"